      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Diana and Abe,\ncan you take a look at this change? It updates the typec status command to also get the partners minor revision if it\u0027s available. This command is how the cros_ec_typec driver gets revision information to register it with the typec connector class. So, this update will allow the partners minor revision information to be accessible in userspace.",
      "revId": "34e73d012b782b26b1b48937a11d2f63aef1f11d",
