      "writtenOn": "2023-01-13T17:12:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If it\u0027s OK to call this from a host command, then it should be `pd_get_partner_rmdo` and declared in `usb_pd.h`. If it\u0027s not safe to call this function from a different task, then you need to provide some kind of synchronized way of doing it.\n\nPerhaps `pd_get_rev` should somehow incorporate the information from the RMDO to keep the API simple.",
      "revId": "34e73d012b782b26b1b48937a11d2f63aef1f11d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
